{
  "slug": "testdino",
  "name": "Testdino",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Use TestDino inside Claude Code through the hosted remote MCP server to inspect test runs, debug failing test cases, manage manual tests, and run TestDino audits.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `testdino-audit` (Use only when the user explicitly asks for a TestDino audit of Playwright automated test code), `testdino-health` (Use when the user wants to check TestDino connection status, validate their PAT, discover available organizations and projects,…), `testdino-manual-runs` (Use when the user wants to manage a manual execution run or update case-level results inside a run…), `testdino-manual-tests` (Use when the user wants to create, update, or browse manual QA test cases and suites in TestDino…), `testdino-releases` (Use when the user wants to browse, inspect, create, or update releases/milestones in a TestDino project), `testdino-runs` (Use when the user wants to inspect automated test runs, list failed or flaky tests, debug a failing…), `testdino-sessions` (Use when the user wants to browse, inspect, create, or update exploratory testing sessions in TestDino — by…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `testdino`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install testdino@claude-community` from `anthropics/claude-plugins-community` (`testdino`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "mcp": 1
  },
